# Keep the build context small and free of secrets.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
.husky
apps/mobile/**
!apps/mobile/package.json
infra/firebase/**
!infra/firebase/package.json
docs
**/*.log
**/coverage

# Render secret files are copied into the build context: keep keys out of images
firebase-key.json
**/firebase-key.json
**/service-account*.json
**/*firebase-adminsdk*.json
